      "body": "## Motivation\n\nThe Intern-S2-Mobius series models fail to launch on CPU platforms.\n\n- When `moe_runner_backend` is set to `auto`, the model override forces the backend to `triton_kernel` regardless of the platform.\n- The current `topk_softmax_cpu` operator cannot handle models with `num_experts: 2560`.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- interns2_mobius.py: Force the use of `triton_kernel` exclusively on CUDA; for all other platforms (including CPU), retain the `auto` setting.\n- Add a code path for the case of 2560 in `topk_softmax_cpu`.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nStartup is normal, and the output is as expected.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41800971825](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41800971825)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41800971867](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41800971867)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41800971779](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41800971779)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
